Beyond All Reason  --  required at runtime, never redistributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Upstream:  https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/Beyond-All-Reason
  License:   code GPL v2; art, animation, sound and music predominantly
             CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0 (some models CC-BY-SA 4.0); some content all
