Verdance's Ashes is a mutator and declares BAR as a dependency
(mod/VerdanceAshes.sdd/modinfo.lua). BAR is resolved from the player's own
installation. No BAR model, texture, animation, sound, icon or music file is
contained in or distributed by this project.

The mutator's Lua does reference BAR unit identifiers (armcom, legcom, armllt
and similar). These are functional interface strings used to address units at
runtime, not copies of BAR's creative content.


